1
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:05,546
网上有个说法：射和矮，这两个字弄反了。
People online say the characters 射 and 矮 got swapped.

2
00:00:05,667 --> 00:00:08,023
射字左边是身，右边是寸。
射 is 身 (body) plus 寸 (inch).

3
00:00:08,023 --> 00:00:10,570
身高一寸，那不就是矮吗？
One inch tall: isn’t that short?

4
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:12,825
矮字左边是矢，矢就是箭；
On the left of 矮 is 矢, an arrow;

5
00:00:12,825 --> 00:00:15,001
右边是委，有放下的意思。
on the right is 委, to let go.

6
00:00:15,001 --> 00:00:17,675
把箭放出去，那不就是射吗？
Letting an arrow go: isn’t that shooting?

7
00:00:17,735 --> 00:00:21,702
其实，射最早画的是一张弓，弓上搭着一支箭。
In fact, the oldest 射 is a bow with an arrow on it.

8
00:00:21,702 --> 00:00:24,332
后来又加了一只手，在拉弓弦。
Later a hand was added, pulling the string.

9
00:00:24,332 --> 00:00:27,092
弓慢慢写成了身，手写成了寸。
The bow slowly became 身, and the hand became 寸.

10
00:00:27,092 --> 00:00:29,050
那矮里为什么有支箭？
Why is there an arrow in 矮?

11
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:31,620
古人拿箭当尺子，用来量长短。
People once used arrows as rulers to measure length.

12
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:34,095
所以短字里，也有这支箭。
That is why 短 (short) has one too.

13
00:00:34,096 --> 00:00:35,649
射，是拉弓放箭；
射 means drawing a bow and shooting;

14
00:00:35,649 --> 00:00:38,578
矮，就是个子短，委只管读音。
矮 means short, and 委 only gives the sound.

15
00:00:39,698 --> 00:00:41,385
所以，没弄反。
So they were never swapped.
